      "preserve": "Before installing a NuGet package or cloning the repository, select the appropriate FHIR version because HL7 specification updates introduce breaking changes.",
      "problem": "The warning embeds its actionable version-selection requirement in metadiscourse ('it is important to understand' and 'you need to ensure'), delaying the reason readers must choose carefully.",
