    },
    {
      "preserve": "Download the package appropriate to the reader's FHIR release; retain the documentation reference.",
      "problem": "'The correct' has no noun, leaving the object of the download instruction unstated. The following sentence and package table establish that the missing object is a package.",
      "quote": ", and download the correct for your FHIR release.",
      "segment_index": 2,
