      "problem": "The opening condition repeats the preceding instruction to choose a download for the reader's FHIR release. The independently useful information here is the location of the package links.",
      "quote": "Depending on the version of FHIR you require, you'll find the relevant link to the package below.",
      "segment_index": 0,
